    "sub_name": "台灣人文概論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO TAIWAN HUMANITIES",
    "describe_ch": "以主題方式，透過文獻的解析，依時間的分期，從明鄭、清領到日治時期，介紹台灣歷史與人文發展狀況，進而引導學生關注當代台灣文化現象與未來發展。\r\n\r\n\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "By discussing different topics, this course will introduce the history, literature and culture of Taiwan from the period of Ming Zheng through the period of Qing's occupation to that of the Japanese colonization.",
